        <activityName xml:lang="en">Facilities, chemical production</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facilities, chemical production
The total weight is based on information about two chemical sites - the composition of material based on information about a destillation unit.;
Synonyms: chemical installation; 
UUID: f7f1e294-89ad-39af-b50d-50dbc5f79d96
This module includes the composition of the facilities for the production of chemicals (compromising storage facilities on-site, synthesis equipement, product separation and refinement installations). 
Location: estimated composition of the facilities of a chemical plant, based on European information
Technology: estimated composition of the facilities of a chemical plant, based on a destillation unit
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f7f1e294-89ad-39af-b50d-50dbc5f79d96.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
